{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50616","headline":"金山 · 皇甫冉","name":"金山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中江一柱碧崚嶒，壁立千寻我独登。\n梵呗波随招过客，钟声船载送归僧。\n窗前白上浪三尺，岭上青堆云几层。\n六代风流衰歇尽，慿栏感喟意难胜。\n（见丹徒陶绍莱辑《润州唐人集》卷七，云：「见净谈《金山志》及缪潜《新志》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}